        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Häny’s technology"
        },
        {
          "type": "columns",
          "ratio": "40-60",
          "left": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "alt": "HÄNY: image 2",
              "width": 351,
              "height": 264,
              "src": "/assets/img/haeny-2.webp",
              "caption": "Mixer"
            }
          ],
          "right": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "text": "Mixing principle"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "For efficient mixing of cement, ultrafine cement and bentonite, Häny mixers create high shear forces with high-speed pumps and a unique vortex impeller. The pumps circulate the entire tank contents 2-4 times per minute, generating extreme turbulence and effective particle separation and ensuring complete hydration."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "This intense hydration gives a stable and easily workable suspension, even for difficult-to-mix additives. The HCM mixer eliminates the need for pre-soaking of bentonite or storage tanks."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "columns",
          "ratio": "40-60",
          "left": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "alt": "HÄNY: image 3",
              "width": 599,
              "height": 440,
              "src": "/assets/img/haeny-3.webp",
              "caption": "Impeller"
            }
          ],
          "right": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "text": "Impeller"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "Häny’s vortex impeller has a large throughput (15-80 mm) and is extremely wear-resistant, which reduces wear and clogging. The HCM 300 and HCM 600 models can mix sandy grouts with particle sizes up to 8 mm. The maintenance-free shaft seal withstands dry running for several minutes without damage."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "columns",
          "ratio": "40-60",
          "left": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "alt": "HÄNY: image 4",
              "width": 682,
              "height": 1548,
              "src": "/assets/img/haeny-4.webp",
              "caption": "Plunger"
            }
          ],
          "right": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "text": "Plunger pump system"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "Unlike piston pumps, plunger pumps do not require close-fitting parts such as cylinders or precise piston seals. The plunger is sealed with a maintenance-free seal, and different diameters can be fitted to the ZMP 700 series pumps for flexible pressure and flow adaptation."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "text": "Valves"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "The injection valves are made of wear-resistant alloy steel with reversible valve seats. The hydraulic system provides a fast suction stroke that keeps the valves clean by flushing away heavy particles. The pumps also handle suspensions with a low water/cement ratio and a high sand content."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "columns",
          "ratio": "40-60",
          "left": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "alt": "HÄNY: image 5",
              "width": 649,
              "height": 490,
              "src": "/assets/img/haeny-5.webp",
              "caption": "Control block for flow control"
            }
          ],
          "right": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "text": "Automatic pressure control"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "ZMP 700 pumps have valves for precise setting of maximum pressure. When the pressure is reached, the flow is adjusted automatically or stopped, while the pressure is maintained. Some models can be set from as low as 1 bar, which enables safe grouting in sensitive formations."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 3,
              "text": "Flow control"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "Built-in flow regulation allows the maximum flow to be set, which enables slow grouting in soft ground conditions without segregation or new voids. Together with the pressure control, the pumps can also be used for permeability tests."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "columns",
          "ratio": "40-60",
          "left": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "/assets/img/ahlm-st-5-2.webp",
              "alt": "Silo",
              "width": 1502,
              "height": 897
            }
          ],
          "right": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": 2,
              "text": "Silo"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "It can often be a good idea to combine the pump with a silo to ensure an even and continuous supply of material. A silo reduces the handling of big bags, improves the workflow and can be fitted with a screw conveyor for automatic feeding to the pump. Click “Read more” to see an example of a silo that we recommend."
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "kind": "link",
              "text": "Read more",
              "href": "/produkter/ahlm/st-5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "HÄNY: image 6",
          "width": 1100,
          "height": 355,
          "src": "/assets/img/haeny-6.webp",
          "inline": true,
          "maxWidth": 190,
          "align": "right"
        }
      ],
      "published": true
    },
